ter Sports - Full Day Staniel Cay Swimming Pigs Tour","blurb":"Swimming pigs at Big Major''s Cay, \"endangered Bahamian Rock Iguanas on Leaf Cay\", nurse sharks at Compass Cay and \"Snorkeling in Thunderball Grotto (Advanced Snorkeling)\"; pickups across Great Exuma; adults from $435, teens $385, children $350, \"covers lunch and landing fees\"; +1 242 357 0555","si":["wildlife","family","tropical","adventure","ocean"],"commission":"operator","wells":["activities","eat","move"],"draw_rank":4,"fit_rules":{"duration":"full-day (operator page: 8 hours)","before":"none","after":"none","pairs_with":"Thunderball snorkel + iguanas","time_season":"year-round, calm-sea AM best (open water)"},"tier_absent_reason":"does-not-compete","source":"https://exumawatersports.com/tours/full-day-007-staniel-cay-swimming-pigs-tour/","accessed":"2026-10-02","wells_basis":"full pass 2026-10-05, additive — text"},{"name":"Fowl Cay Resort","blurb":"All-inclusive private island near Staniel Cay: six oceanfront villas for 2-6 guests, each with a \"personal powerboat with unlimited fuel\", \"all meals and drinks (incl. premium alcohol)\", tennis and a freshwater pool; Unique Travel Corp. is worldwide representative; 1-877-845-5275","si":["romance","tropical","yacht","family"],"commission":"hotel","wells":["stay","eat","move"],"draw_rank":5,"tier_absent_reason":"not-established","source":"https://www.fowlcay.com/","accessed":"2026-10-02"},{"name":"Staniel Cay Yacht Club","blurb":"\"a hidden gem in the Exuma Cays of the Bahamas\" - bungalows, villas and suites with a marina, restaurant and pool; promotes the swimming pigs and Thunderball Grotto; Makers Air and Charter Flights Florida linked for flights; info@stanielcay.com, (954) 467-6658","si":["yacht","tropical","wildlife","romance","sailing"],"commission":"hotel","wells":["stay","eat"],"draw_rank":6,"tier_absent_reason":"not-established","source":"https://www.stanielcay.com/","accessed":"2026-10-02"},{"name":"Chat ''N'' Chill, Stocking Island"